[{"id": 100709, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 0, "user": "alfredo", "user_id": 161287, "date": "2026-09-06 11:22:07", "date_gmt": "2026-09-06 09:22:07", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-06T09:22:07+00:00", "content": "I measured the four required lengths and marked all of them on the filament with a permanent marker. Then just inserted the filament until the required mark was visible.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": [{"id": 100767, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "sworcester", "user_id": 155744, "date": "2026-09-06 21:56:50", "date_gmt": "2026-09-06 19:56:50", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-06T19:56:50+00:00", "content": "so\n300mm\n270mm\n240mm\n210mm", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 101117, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "NickT_in_SD", "user_id": 214342, "date": "2026-09-10 01:35:58", "date_gmt": "2026-09-09 23:35:58", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-09T23:35:58+00:00", "content": "Amazing suggestion. The manual should be rewritten. I also made small line marks on the PTFE tube with a permanent marker after measuring just in case I ever have to disassemble and reassemble.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 102087, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "langjai", "user_id": 144023, "date": "2026-09-20 04:54:54", "date_gmt": "2026-09-20 02:54:54", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-20T02:54:54+00:00", "content": "Unfortunately, the permanent markers that I had didn&#039;t want to stay on the PTFE.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 102698, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "Leah V", "user_id": 183502, "date": "2026-09-27 23:57:21", "date_gmt": "2026-09-27 21:57:21", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-27T21:57:21+00:00", "content": "Thanks for this - they definitely need to rewrite this step.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 102813, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "Spetz", "user_id": 114996, "date": "2026-09-29 21:17:28", "date_gmt": "2026-09-29 19:17:28", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-29T19:17:28+00:00", "content": "This is the way.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 102814, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100709, "user": "katespace", "user_id": 144355, "date": "2026-09-29 22:29:15", "date_gmt": "2026-09-29 20:29:15", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-29T20:29:15+00:00", "content": "This is such a better way to do this.\n\nUse a light-colored filament, as it&#039;s much easier to see the marks.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}]}, {"id": 100474, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 0, "user": "Sepur", "user_id": 194162, "date": "2026-09-04 19:23:42", "date_gmt": "2026-09-04 17:23:42", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-04T17:23:42+00:00", "content": "A small tip from my side: Put the filament inside the PTFE tube from the loose end, push it in with spare material from any spool until it enters the sensor, adjust the length in the holder and push the measuring filament out. Makes this step much easier to handle.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": [{"id": 100634, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100474, "user": "billiam3d", "user_id": 106290, "date": "2026-09-05 20:41:49", "date_gmt": "2026-09-05 18:41:49", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-05T18:41:49+00:00", "content": "This method was a freaking gamechanger! Highly recommend.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}, {"id": 102086, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100474, "user": "langjai", "user_id": 144023, "date": "2026-09-20 04:54:02", "date_gmt": "2026-09-20 02:54:02", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-20T02:54:02+00:00", "content": "This is genius!", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}]}, {"id": 100399, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 0, "user": "bioxz", "user_id": 176508, "date": "2026-09-03 19:47:55", "date_gmt": "2026-09-03 17:47:55", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-03T17:47:55+00:00", "content": "My filament is still &quot;at least&quot; 300mm long (e.g. 400mm). The step before told to not cut anything yet. I guess it should be cut to exactly 300mm at this point?", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": [{"id": 100472, "post_id": 1103451, "parent": 100399, "user": "Sepur", "user_id": 194162, "date": "2026-09-04 19:09:52", "date_gmt": "2026-09-04 17:09:52", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-04T17:09:52+00:00", "content": "In the previous step it says &quot;the initial length is 300mm&quot;", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}]}]